er: {{customer_name}}<br />\n• Account Number: {{account_number}}<br />\n• Account Type: {{account_type}}<br />\n• Member Since: {{join_date}}</p>\n<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 16px;">💳 Your Digital Card (Ready to Use):<br />\nCard Number: **** **** **** {{card_last_4}}<br />\nCard Type: {{card_type}}<br />\nStatus: ✅ ACTIVATED</p>\n<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 16px;">🏦 What You Can Do Now:<br />\n1. Access Online Banking: {{online_banking_url}}<br />\n2. Download Our Mobile App: {{mobile_app_link}}<br />\n3. Set Up Direct Deposit<br />\n4. Make Your First Deposit<br />\n5. Explore Account Benefits</p>\n<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 16px;">🔒 Security First:<br />\n• Never share your password or PIN<br />\n• Enable two-factor authentication<br />\n• Monitor your account regularly<br />\n• Report suspicious activity immediately</p>\n<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 16px;">📞 Need Assistance?<br />\nOur customer support team is here to help:<br />\n• Phone: {{support_phone}}<br />\n• Email: {{support_email}}<br />\n• Live Chat: {{chat_url}}<br />\n• Hours: {{support_hours}}</p>\n<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 16px;">📍 Visit Us:<br />\n{{branch_address}}<br />\n{{branch_hours}}</p>\n<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 16px;">💡 Pro Tips for New Customers:<br />\n• Set up account alerts<br />\n• Schedule bill payments<br />\n• Explore savings goals<br />\n• Check out our financial tools</p>\n<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 16px;">Welcome to smarter banking!</p>\n<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 16px;">Best regards,</p>\n<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 16px;">{{bank_name}} Team<br />\n{{company_website}}</p>\n<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 16px;">---<br />\nThis is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.<br />\nFor security reasons, never share your account details via email.<br />\n© {{current_year}} {{bank_name}}. All rights reserved.</p>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Footer -->\n                <div style="background-color: #edf2f7; padding: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">\n                    <div style="text-align: center; color: #718096; font-size: 14px;">\n                        <p style="margin: 5px 0;">\n                            <strong>{{company_name}}</strong>\n                        </p>\n                        <p style="margin: 5px 0;">\n                            Phone: <span style="color: #2c5282;">{{support_phone}}</span> | \n                            Email: <span style="color: #2c5282;">{{support_email}}</span>\n                        </p>\n                        <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #a0aec0;">\n                            © 2024 {{company_name}}. All rights reserved.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n        </body>\n</html>	alert	\N	welcome_email	t	\N	2026-02-06 02:34:22.957789	2026-02-06 02:34:22.957789	"[]"
